        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3d89a72c-c1e8-40d8-8c88-1ffccf308334).Image",
        "Description": "It seems like this is never going to end 47... Do you remember that Banker client a few weeks back. He needs some more help. A guy named Levin Tolkien has threatend to reveal our clients biggest secret and he needs to &apos;&apos;Disapear&apos;&apos; before he reveals anything major. The other target is a news writer who works part time at a seedy night club in the middle of the forest. Our two targets are going to meet there and you need to put them down before they reveal something major. \r\rGood luck 47\r\rMr. S",
